<title>USA: N.Y. metal futures opening forecasts.</title>
<headline>N.Y. metal futures opening forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Precious metals and copper futures were called to open by traders as follows:</p>
<p>April gold - unchanged to down $0.30 an ounce</p>
<p>March silver - unchanged to up 0.20 cent</p>
<p>April platinum - unchanged to off $0.20</p>
<p>March palladium - unchanged to up $0.50</p>
<p>March copper - unchanged to down 0.30 cent a lb</p>
<p>--New York Commodities Desk 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
